:"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610763006:0":{"text":"……原来真是这样啊。其实，我早就知道了。","source_cn":"……原来真是这样啊。其实，我早就知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A423EE1DC214CDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610763007:1":{"text":"格墨文？你……你知道？","source_cn":"格墨文？你……你知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F0EBD7B43C7B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610763008:1":{"text":"应该说，是我猜到的。但那又怎么样呢？我其实并不介意这一点。","source_cn":"应该说，是我猜到的。但那又怎么样呢？我其实并不介意这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x105B324D88813853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610763009:1":{"text":"你……不介意？","source_cn":"你……不介意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BAC61A3898CD3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610763010:1":{"text":"恕我直言，我已经很习惯周旋于一个个贵族之间，表面看似热情，背后却往往充满了利益交换、算计和背叛。","source_cn":"恕我直言，我已经很习惯周旋于一个个贵族之间，表面看似热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0FE4D8B82F9272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610763011:1":{"text":"而你，休，虽然你打算利用我接近王室，但你也是真心想和我成为朋友。而在利益和友谊之间，你选择了友谊，为此，你甚至愿意向我道歉和坦白。","source_cn":